sequenceDiagram
  actor Human as Requester/Approver
  participant CP as Control plane
  participant AI as Model Gateway
  participant EP as Execution plane
  participant CR as Cyber range
  participant OP as Observability
  Human->>CP: signed engagement and ROE
  CP->>CP: verify schema/signature/policy
  CP->>AI: minimized context + ID tools
  AI-->>CP: structured proposal
  CP->>CP: policy and approval decision
  opt approval required
    CP->>Human: canonical action review
    Human-->>CP: bound approval
  end
  CP->>EP: signed opaque job intent
  EP->>EP: reauthorize, create Runner and lease
  EP->>CR: fixed approved test
  CR-->>EP: synthetic result
  EP->>OP: telemetry and evidence
  EP-->>CP: redacted status and evidence IDs
  CP->>AI: evidence derivative
  AI-->>CP: finding or patch proposal
